### =====================================================
### Variables
### =====================================================
@backend_base=http://localhost:8080

### =====================================================
### GET /api/v1/meta
### - Get app version (no auth required)
### =====================================================

GET {{backend_base}}/api/v1/meta
Accept: application/json


### =====================================================
### GET /api/v1/meta/changelog
### - Get changelog (no auth required)
### =====================================================

GET {{backend_base}}/api/v1/meta/changelog
Accept: application/json